#: ../../source/docs/tkoff-rpm-min.rst:5 141f416db2494aa09bdf97242b2a7581
msgid "Dead Motor Takeoff Prevention"
msgstr "故障电机起飞预防"

#: ../../source/docs/tkoff-rpm-min.rst:7 40e7b52b0dac4622a5d9dff708cdd37b
msgid ""
"Ardupilot provides mechanism to prevent flips on takeoff if a motor, or "
"motors, is not operating at a minimum rpm due to damage. It requires that "
"ESC RPM telemetry is being used. See the ``ESC Telemetry - Average Motor "
"RPM`` section of :ref:`common-rpm` for setup."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 提供了一种机制，可防止在某个或某些电机因损坏而未达到最低转速时起飞翻转。此功能需要使用 ESC 转速遥测。设置方法请参阅 "
":ref:`common-rpm` 中的\"ESC 遥测 - 平均电机转速\"部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/tkoff-rpm-min.rst:9 2ee82ac9b01e4b8a996c2a6f7c9da057
msgid ""
"Then, by setting the :ref:`TKOFF_RPM_MIN<TKOFF_RPM_MIN>` slightly below the "
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM <MOT_SPIN_ARM>`, if the average rpm is lower than this, "
"throttle increases will not be passed on, preventing a takeoff and an "
"immediate flip."
msgstr ""
"然后，通过将 :ref:`TKOFF_RPM_MIN<TKOFF_RPM_MIN>` 设置为略低于 :ref:`MOT_SPIN_ARM "
"<MOT_SPIN_ARM>` 的值，如果平均转速低于此值，油门增加指令将不会传递，从而防止起飞并避免立即翻转。"
